      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling this way; it is incredibly painful to disconnect from the person you used to know. Please know that when you feel like a ghost, you are seeking help that is more important than any person you thought everyone would care about. Reaching out to a mental health professional or a support line like 988 (in the US) can help you find the \"real you\" that is still there, even if it is hard to see right now.",
